{
 "duration": 56.450612,
 "frames": 1694,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Why is the Statue of Liberty green?",
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 2.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Because she wasn't always.",
   "start": 2.66,
   "end": 3.94
  },
  {
   "text": "In eighteen eighty-six,",
   "start": 4.66,
   "end": 5.88
  },
  {
   "text": "France gave America a giant gift: a lady made of shiny copper.",
   "start": 6.2,
   "end": 10.98
  },
  {
   "text": "She glowed like a brand-new penny.",
   "start": 11.56,
   "end": 13.66
  },
  {
   "text": "But copper has a secret.",
   "start": 14.26,
   "end": 16.0
  },
  {
   "text": "When it meets rain,",
   "start": 16.5,
   "end": 17.46
  },
  {
   "text": "wind and salty sea air,",
   "start": 17.76,
   "end": 19.42
  },
  {
   "text": "it slowly changes.",
   "start": 19.76,
   "end": 21.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Within about twenty years,",
   "start": 21.66,
   "end": 23.04
  },
  {
   "text": "Lady Liberty went from penny brown to minty green.",
   "start": 23.3,
   "end": 26.58
  },
  {
   "text": "People panicked.",
   "start": 27.16,
   "end": 28.26
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen-oh-six,",
   "start": 28.78,
   "end": 29.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Congress set aside money to paint her back to copper.",
   "start": 30.06,
   "end": 32.8
  },
  {
   "text": "New Yorkers were furious.",
   "start": 33.3,
   "end": 35.04
  },
  {
   "text": "Some called it sacrilege.",
   "start": 35.5,
   "end": 36.94
  },
  {
   "text": "So engineers took a closer look,",
   "start": 37.5,
   "end": 39.5
  },
  {
   "text": "and found something surprising.",
   "start": 39.76,
   "end": 41.28
  },
  {
   "text": "That green coat wasn't damage.",
   "start": 41.78,
   "end": 43.7
  },
  {
   "text": "It was armor.",
   "start": 44.12,
   "end": 44.96
  },
  {
   "text": "A thin skin called patina that protects the metal underneath.",
   "start": 45.44,
   "end": 48.92
  },
  {
   "text": "So the paint was never used.",
   "start": 49.44,
   "end": 51.16
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why the Statue of Liberty is green.",
   "start": 51.64,
   "end": 53.58
  },
  {
   "text": "Her \"rust\" is what protects her.",
   "start": 54.04,
   "end": 56.22
  }
 ]
}